 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Future with werden",
   "texto": [
    "**werden** is conjugated and the main verb goes infinitive at the end: **Ich werde morgen anrufen** (tomorrow I will call). **Werden** can also express a foresight or assumption: **Es wird bald regnen** (it will probably rain soon). For plans already planned, the present is very common with a time expression: **Morgen rufe ich dich an** (I call you tomorrow). The future with **werden** does not in itself mean that a plan is more formal or safer."
   ]
  },
